{
  "_id": "5ce54be0-e777-4111-858c-7b31e06406d6",
  "body": {
    "en": [
      {
        "_key": "t30a3",
        "_type": "tldrBox",
        "items": [
          "A theme isn't taste — it's **strategy**: dark and light do different jobs.",
          "**Dark** sells tech and premium; **light** sells trust, ease, healthcare",
          "A 50+ audience and long reading = light. Portfolio, IT, premium brand = dark can work",
          "A theme toggle looks great but costs more to maintain: every screen gets tested twice"
        ],
        "title": "In 60 seconds"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t30a4",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t30a5",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "\"Make ours dark, it looks stylish\" — I hear it all the time. Sometimes I agree, sometimes I refuse. Because a theme isn't about style — it's about who you sell to and what. Let's sort it without taste debates."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t30a6",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t30a7",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "When a dark theme works"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t30aa",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t30a8",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "strong"
            ],
            "text": "A tech product or studio. "
          },
          {
            "_key": "t30a9",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "A dark background reads as \"engineering\" — that's why IT brands pick it. Our own site is dark for exactly this reason."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t30ad",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t30ab",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "strong"
            ],
            "text": "Premium and visual products. "
          },
          {
            "_key": "t30ac",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Photos and graphics \"glow\" on dark — portfolios, architecture, cars win."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t30ag",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t30ae",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "strong"
            ],
            "text": "Evening usage context. "
          },
          {
            "_key": "t30af",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Entertainment, events, gaming — the audience scrolls at night, and dark is easier on the eyes."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t30ah",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t30ai",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "When light is the only right choice"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t30al",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t30aj",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "strong"
            ],
            "text": "Healthcare and anywhere trust is the product. "
          },
          {
            "_key": "t30ak",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Light equals cleanliness and openness. A dark clinic quietly unsettles — which is why we build medical sites light, even though we live in a dark theme ourselves."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t30ao",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t30am",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "strong"
            ],
            "text": "A 50+ audience. "
          },
          {
            "_key": "t30an",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Contrast sensitivity drops with age: light text on dark gets harder to read. If your patient or buyer is older — don't fight their eyes."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t30ar",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t30ap",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "strong"
            ],
            "text": "Long-form text. "
          },
          {
            "_key": "t30aq",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Blogs, documentation, catalogues with descriptions — long reading on dark tires faster."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t30au",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t30as",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "strong"
            ],
            "text": "Print and offline pairing. "
          },
          {
            "_key": "t30at",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "If the site extends brochures, menus and price lists, a light theme keeps the set coherent."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t30av",
        "_type": "blogImage",
        "alt": "A designer's workspace with two monitors",
        "asset": {
          "_ref": "image-49b2292f7f3193cb6bb012237fa8e69a22462f46-1600x1067-jpg",
          "_type": "reference"
        },
        "caption": "The audience picks the theme, not the designer's taste: light the way you sell"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t30aw",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t30ax",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Whatever the theme: contrast and accessibility"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t30ay",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t30az",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "The real mistake isn't \"dark or light\" — it's grey text on grey. A minimum 4.5:1 contrast for body text (the WCAG standard) isn't bureaucracy; it's the difference between \"read it\" and \"closed it\". Dark themes have their own trap: pure white on pure black \"rings\" — softer tones read better."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t30b0",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t30b1",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "What about a toggle?"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t30b2",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t30b3",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Possible — we build them. But honestly: a toggle doubles design testing, because every screen, illustration and chart must work in both themes. For content sites and products it's justified; for a services site it usually isn't. One theme, executed flawlessly, beats two done halfway."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t30b4",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t30b5",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Choose in 4 questions"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t30b6",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t30b7",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Who do you sell to? 50+ or healthcare/finance → light"
          }
        ],
        "level": 1,
        "listItem": "number",
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t30b8",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t30b9",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "What do you show? Lots of photos and visuals → dark can work"
          }
        ],
        "level": 1,
        "listItem": "number",
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t30ba",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t30bb",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "How much do they read? Long-form → light"
          }
        ],
        "level": 1,
        "listItem": "number",
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t30bc",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t30bd",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "What's the brand? Tech/premium → dark works for you"
          }
        ],
        "level": 1,
        "listItem": "number",
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t30bl",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t30be",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "These considerations are part of a wider conversation about trust in design: "
          },
          {
            "_key": "t30bg",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "t30bf"
            ],
            "text": "what builds trust on medical websites"
          },
          {
            "_key": "t30bh",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": " and "
          },
          {
            "_key": "t30bj",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "t30bi"
            ],
            "text": "9 moves that lifted conversion"
          },
          {
            "_key": "t30bk",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [
          {
            "_key": "t30bf",
